🎉 Welcome to TimeOff.Management!
=====
<h2>Hello {{new_user.name}},</h2>

<div class="info-box info-box-success">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #059669;">🎉 Your Account is Ready!</h3>
  <p><strong>{{#with admin_user}}{{this.full_name}}{{/with}}</strong> has created your TimeOff.Management account for
    <strong>{{company.name}}</strong>.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="content-card">
  <div class="content-card-header">
    <h3 style="margin: 0; color: #1f2937;">🔐 Set Up Your Password</h3>
  </div>
  <div class="content-card-body">
    <p>To get started, you'll need to set up your password. You can do this in two ways:</p>

    <div style="margin: 20px 0;">
      <h4 style="color: #1f2937; margin-bottom: 8px;">Option 1: Contact Your Admin</h4>
      <p>Contact <strong>{{admin_user.name}}</strong> to get your initial password and login details.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin: 20px 0;">
      <h4 style="color: #1f2937; margin-bottom: 8px;">Option 2: Set Password Directly</h4>
      <p>Click the button below to set your password:</p>
      <div style="text-align: center; margin: 20px 0;">
        {{# with new_user ~}}
        <a href="{{concatenate (get_application_domain) '/reset-password/?t=' ../token}}" class="btn"
          style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #3b82f6; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 16px;">Set
          My Password</a>
        {{/ with }}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="info-box">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #1f2937;">🌐 Access Your Account</h3>
  <p>Once you have your password, you can access your TimeOff.Management account here:</p>
  <div style="text-align: center; margin: 15px 0;">
    <a href="{{get_application_domain}}" class="btn btn-secondary"
      style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #6b7280; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 16px;">Login
      to TimeOff.Management</a>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="info-box info-box-success">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #059669;">📱 Mobile Access</h3>
  <p><strong>Save TimeOff.Management to your home screen for easy access:</strong></p>
  <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin: 0;">
    <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>📱 iOS (Safari):</strong> Open the site → tap the <em>Share</em> icon →
      choose <em>Add to Home Screen</em> → <em>Add</em></li>
    <li style="margin-bottom: 0;"><strong>🤖 Android (Chrome):</strong> Open the site → tap the <em>⋮</em> menu → choose
      <em>Add to Home screen</em> (or <em>Install app</em>) → <em>Add</em>
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="info-box">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #1f2937;">🚀 What You Can Do</h3>
  <p>With your TimeOff.Management account, you can:</p>
  <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin: 0;">
    <li style="margin-bottom: 6px;">📅 Request time off and view your leave balance</li>
    <li style="margin-bottom: 6px;">📊 View your team's calendar and availability</li>
    <li style="margin-bottom: 6px;">📱 Access everything from your mobile device</li>
    <li style="margin-bottom: 0;">🔔 Get notifications about leave requests and approvals</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<p style="margin-top: 20px;">Welcome to the team!<br><strong>The TimeOff.Management Team</strong></p>